<section class="shell intro-hero"><p class="eyebrow">SERVICENOW CHANGES. READY TO SHIP.</p><h1>It works.<br><em>Now make it shippable.</em></h1><p class="intro-lead">A CLI for ServiceNow that fits the way your team already ships.<br>Follow one real change, from the first command to a completed update set.</p>
<div class="intro-video" id="introduction"><% if @intro_video && URI.parse(@intro_video.url).path.match?(/\.(mp4|webm)\z/i) %><video controls preload="metadata" src="<%= @intro_video.url %>" aria-label="JSN introduction: from install to a shippable change"></video><% elsif @intro_video %><div class="intro-poster"><p class="eyebrow">THE FULL WALKTHROUGH</p><h2>One table.<br>A change your team can ship.</h2><a class="button" href="<%= @intro_video.url %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Watch the introduction ↗</a></div><% else %><div class="intro-poster"><div class="poster-top"><span>JSN / THE FIRST CHANGE</span><span class="coming-soon">VIDEO COMING SOON</span></div><div class="poster-story"><div><p class="eyebrow">FROM THE WORKBENCH TO THE UPDATE SET</p><h2>One table.<br>A change your<br>team can ship.</h2><p>Install. Connect. Build. Test. Ship.</p></div><svg viewBox="0 0 320 240" role="img" aria-label="A simple line drawing of a boat"><path d="M35 165h250l-42 46H79zM158 26v139M147 40L56 151h91zM170 57v94h90zM20 225q25-13 50 0t50 0t50 0t50 0t50 0t50 0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><div class="poster-bottom"><code>$ npm i -g @jacebenson/jsn</code><span>~11 MIN · ONE REAL WORKFLOW</span></div></div><% end %></div>
<div class="intro-caption"><span><strong>The first change.</strong> From “it works” to something your team can review, promote, and back out.</span><a href="/docs/install/">Get started now →</a></div>
<details class="intro-chapters"><summary>Inside the walkthrough <span>10 chapters · about 11 minutes</span></summary><ol><% [['0:00','The change that stayed in Default'],['1:05','Meet JSN'],['1:45','What you’ll need'],['2:30','Install the CLI'],['4:00','Connect your instance'],['6:00','Create and select an update set'],['7:00','Build the boat table with your agent'],['9:00','Test it with a real record'],['9:45','Review and complete the change'],['10:20','Ready for your team']].each do |time, title| %><li><time><%= time %></time><span><%= title %></span></li><% end %></ol></details></section>
<section class="start-band"><div class="shell steps"><p class="eyebrow">NEW HERE?<br><strong>Start small.</strong></p><a href="/docs/install/"><span>01 / GET READY</span><h3>Install JSN ↗</h3><p>Get the toolkit into your terminal.</p></a><a href="/features/<%= @features.find { |f| f['id'] == 'auth' }['canonicalSlug'] %>/"><span>02 / CONNECT</span><h3>Meet your instance →</h3><p>Walk through your first connection.</p></a><a href="#features"><span>03 / TRY SOMETHING</span><h3>Pick a feature ↓</h3><p>Find a workflow that helps today.</p></a></div></section>
<section class="shell library" id="features"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE FEATURE LIBRARY</p><h2>What would you like to do?</h2></div><p>One feature at a time.<br>Practical examples, with video walkthroughs as they arrive.</p></div><div class="filters"><label class="search">⌕ <input id="feature-search" type="search" placeholder="Find a feature…" aria-label="Search features"></label><div class="chips" role="group" aria-label="Filter by workflow"><button class="active" aria-pressed="true" data-group="All">All features</button><% @features.map { |f| f['group'] }.uniq.each do |group| %><button aria-pressed="false" data-group="<%= group %>"><%= group %></button><% end %></div></div><p id="result-count" class="small" aria-live="polite"><%= @features.length %> features to explore</p><div class="feature-grid"><% @features.each_with_index do |feature, index| %><a class="feature-card" data-group="<%= feature['group'] %>" href="/features/<%= feature['canonicalSlug'] %>/"><div class="card-art tone-<%= index % 4 %>"><span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true"><%= %w[⌘ ↗ ≋ ◇][index % 4] %></span><span class="video-badge"><%= @videos[feature['canonicalSlug']] ? '▶ Watch walkthrough' : '↗ Explore feature' %></span></div><div class="card-body"><p class="eyebrow"><%= feature['group'] %></p><h3><%= feature['title'] %><span>↗</span></h3><p><%= feature['tagline'] %></p></div></a><% end %></div><p id="empty-results" hidden>No features match yet. Try another word or choose All features.</p></section>
<script>const search=document.querySelector('#feature-search'),buttons=[...document.querySelectorAll('button[data-group]')],cards=[...document.querySelectorAll('.feature-card')];let group='All';function filter(){let count=0;cards.forEach(card=>{const show=(group==='All'||card.dataset.group===group)&&card.textContent.toLowerCase().includes(search.value.toLowerCase());card.hidden=!show;if(show)count++});document.querySelector('#result-count').textContent=count+' features to explore';document.querySelector('#empty-results').hidden=count!==0}search.addEventListener('input',filter);buttons.forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{group=button.dataset.group;buttons.forEach(b=>{b.classList.toggle('active',b===button);b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(b===button))});filter()}));</script>
